  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently near all new worlds are using new locomotion, and it works great for games made with udon. \nBut for typical vrchat world its mostly annoying, and just less fun. People when visiting new worlds often do one of 2 things, look for mirror or for random high point to climb to. With new defaults it will be much more limited for no reason. \nAnd to use old locomotion... yea, currently its more work than needed, it just be easy to access option directly on world component or just legacy as default.\nVrChat is not a game, let us have fun by default, and if someone want to make game in their world, then sure, they should have access to any tools like that to prevent any possible abuse. \nBut otherwise... I just want to visit world and have fun.",
